<title>SPAIN: Telefonica, BCH, Banesto to buy Antena 3 - radio.</title>
<headline>Telefonica, BCH, Banesto to buy Antena 3 - radio.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish state radio said on Wednesday that Telefonica de Espana, Banco Central Hispano and Banesto would each buy a 25 percent stake in the private television station Antena 3.</p>
<p>The remaining 25 percent of the commercial television channel would be distributed among other shareholders, the radio said. A Telefonica spokesman confirmed the company was buying a stake in Antena 3, but would not say how much.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 341 585 2160</p>
</text>
